# 📖 TOEIC Grammar - Day17

## Topic
# 수동태 심화
### be + p.p. / have been + p.p.

---

## 1. 기본 수동태

### Structure

be + p.p.

능동:
The manager approved the proposal.

수동:
The proposal was approved by the manager.

---

## 2. 시제에 따른 수동태

### 현재

am / is / are + p.p.

The reports are reviewed every week.

### 과거

was / were + p.p.

The report was reviewed yesterday.

### 미래

will be + p.p.

The new system will be installed next week.

---

## 3. 현재완료 수동태

### Structure

have / has been + p.p.

Examples:

- The project has been completed.
- The documents have been submitted.
- The equipment has been repaired.

---

## TOEIC 핵심

수동태인지 판단하려면

**주어가 행동을 하는가?**
→ 능동

**주어가 행동을 당하는가?**
→ 수동

Example:

The manager _____ the report.

→ manager가 행동함
→ reviewed

The report _____ by the manager.

→ report가 행동을 당함
→ was reviewed

---

## Important

❌ The report has completed.

✅ The report has been completed.

현재완료 수동태:

**have/has + been + p.p.**
